{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/class_f_01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/class_f_01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "F80DCD9BF3F4D6BC",
      "text": "小生是负责教美术的八朔。\\n请多指教是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "F80DD09BF3F4DBD5",
      "text": "……说到何谓美术！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "F80DCF9BF3F4DA22",
      "text": "在座的大多数同学在毕业后，\\n都会将这门课所教的知识\\r\\n忘得一干二净吧！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "F80DCA9BF3F4D1A3",
      "text": "毕竟在考试和就业时，\\n是不会要求美术知识和美感的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "F80DC99BF3F4CFF0",
      "text": "如此一来，小生的这门课\\n难道就只是浪费时间吗？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "F80DCC9BF3F4D509",
      "text": "……一定不是。\\n小生希望不是。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "F80DCB9BF3F4D356",
      "text": "各位同学请思考一下，\\n“美”与“不美”的区别\\r\\n究竟在哪里呢？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1A79702FE1688C5D",
      "text": "颜色与形状",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1A796D2FE1688744",
      "text": "因人而异",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1A796E2FE16888F7",
      "text": "我不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8535359B48B5456D",
      "text": "嗯，原来如此……\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你是如此认为的啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "F80DD69BF3F4E607",
      "text": "不，别在意。\\n这道题没有正确答案。\\r\\n重要的是要各位同学去思考。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "F80DD59BF3F4E454",
      "text": "比如在看到路旁绽放的花朵时，\\n为什么会感到它很美丽呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "F80A489BF3F1BEE6",
      "text": "天空的蓝与大海的蓝，差别在哪里？\\n为什么树木的颜色会发生变化？\\r\\n深钵镇风车的转动……\\r\\n玻瓶市水流的冷冽……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "F80A499BF3F1C099",
      "text": "通过思考，我们能够更鲜明、\\n更深刻地去感受身旁的所有事物。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_12",
      "hash64": "F80A469BF3F1BB80",
      "text": "那一定能够在各位学习学累时，\\n或在工作上遇到难关时……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "F80A479BF3F1BD33",
      "text": "成为从背后轻轻\\n鼓励各位的一股助力哦。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "F80A4C9BF3F1C5B2",
      "text": "……今天的内容有点深奥，\\n就算没听懂也没有关系的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "F80A4D9BF3F1C765",
      "text": "总之，何谓美术！\\n人生可以没有美术，但是……\\r\\n有了它，你的人生一定会更快乐！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_16",
      "hash64": "F80A4A9BF3F1C24C",
      "text": "要是美术能够为同学们的生活\\n增添一些色彩，小生会感到很喜悦的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_01_dragon_17",
      "hash64": "F80A4B9BF3F1C3FF",
      "text": "下堂课开始，我们就用\\n更实践的方式去接触何谓美吧！下课！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
